%% PropLead Concierge: editable architecture source (Mermaid).
%% Paste into https://mermaid.live or any Mermaid renderer. architecture.svg and architecture.png
%% were drawn separately from the same structure; this text file was not rendered when it was written.
flowchart TD
  C[Website enquiry<br/>HTTP POST, JSON] --> W

  subgraph WFA[WF-A Intake Pipeline]
    W[1 Lead Intake Webhook] --> V[2 Authentication and Validation<br/>header token, clean fields]
    V -->|invalid or spam| REJ[422 rejected, logged]
    V --> S[3 Security and Spam Checks<br/>spam rules, prompt-injection flag]
    S --> D[4 Duplicate Check<br/>same email or phone updates one lead]
    D -->|duplicate| DUP[200 duplicate, 0 AI calls]
    D --> P[5 Property Matching<br/>available only, best 3]
    P -->|injection flagged: AI skipped| SC
    P --> E[6 Mistral Embeddings<br/>mistral-embed, 1024]
    E --> K[7 pgvector Knowledge Base<br/>17 policy documents]
    K --> G[8 Groq AI Qualification]
    G -->|Groq fails| OR[9 OpenRouter Fallback]
    OR -->|both fail| RO[10 Rules-Only Fallback]
    G -->|valid JSON| SC
    OR -->|valid JSON| SC
    RO --> SC[11 Lead Scoring<br/>rules 0-60 plus AI 0-40, caps]
    SC --> R[12 Reply Generation<br/>grounded, guard, template fallback]
    R --> RESP[Webhook response<br/>category and draft reply]
    RESP -->|HOT only| T[13 Telegram HOT Alert<br/>no contact data]
  end

  DB[(Supabase PostgreSQL<br/>agency_config, properties, leads,<br/>kb_documents, run_log, error_log)]
  D <--> DB
  P <--> DB
  K <--> DB
  SC <--> DB

  subgraph WFB[WF-B Daily Digest]
    DG[14 Daily Digest<br/>counts, WARM, stale leads, AI summary] --> TG1[Telegram digest]
  end
  DB --> DG

  subgraph WFC[WF-C Global Error Handler]
    EH[15 Error Handler<br/>scrub personal data] --> TG2[Telegram error notice]
    EH --> DB
  end
  WFA -. any failure .-> EH

  subgraph WFD[WF-D KB Ingestion, manual]
    ING[Embed new or changed documents<br/>Mistral] --> DB
  end
